*   **Extend Accounts Payable:** Negotiate longer payment terms (e.g., Net 60 or Net 90) with your own vendors to keep cash in the bank longer.
*   **Revenue Reinvestment:** Allocate a portion of the $1.8M quarterly revenue directly into high-converting sales channels to offset the burn rate entirely, pushing the company toward being cash-flow positive.

